IndyTextColorHelp=Uncheck Automatic contrast to choose banner, table or grand total text. Body and footer text must contrast with the page background (minimum 4.5:1). Explicit colors in rich HTML content take precedence.
IndyContrastError=Colors were not saved: insufficient text contrast (minimum 4.5:1). Choose lighter text on dark backgrounds, darker text on light backgrounds, or enable automatic contrast.
IndyPaymentAndMentions=Bank transfer and native Dolibarr text
IndyBankAccounts=Bank accounts and payment details
IndyNativeBankHelp=Enter the account holder, IBAN and BIC in the native Dolibarr bank account, then select it in Invoices → Defaults → Suggest payment by bank transfer. A document-specific account takes priority. By default Dolibarr prints bank details for an empty payment method or Bank transfer, except on credit notes.
INDYINVOICE_SHOW_BANK_DETAILS=Also print bank details when another payment method is selected (except credit notes)
INDYINVOICE_USE_INVOICE_TEXT_FOR_ORDERS=Use invoice free text for orders without their own free text
IndyNativeMentionsHelp=Configure invoice free text and draft watermark in the native invoice settings. Orders have separate settings. Save with Modify in Dolibarr, then regenerate the PDF using indy (invoice) or indyorder (order). Long text wraps automatically. Validation, document sharing and notification settings remain managed by Dolibarr.

IndyBillingRecipient=Billing recipient
IndyBillingRecipientHelp=Replaces the third-party name in the recipient block of Indy invoice and order PDFs. Leave blank to use the usual name. Contacts and addresses are unchanged.
